stream brings Celestial Church of Christ (CCC) Worldwide services to your Meta Quest, on a large screen wherever you are.\n\nThe app opens straight into whatever is on air:\n- Live service: Sunday and weekday services, revivals, conventions and special programmes as they happen\n- Studio 2: live programmes from the CCC Worldwide Community Hub studio\n- CCC Worldwide 24/7: past services, sermons and hymns around the clock\n\nWhen a service is live it plays straight away. Between services the 24/7 channel plays. Tap the picture to show the title and player controls; when more than one channel is on, buttons let you switch between them.\n\n- No sign-in or account needed\n- No ads and no purchases\n- Resizable window: watch big while you relax, or small next to other apps\n\nCelestial Worldwide Livestream is the official player of the Celestial Church of Christ Worldwide Community, a church in Chicago, Illinois. More at ccc-worldwide.org.", "short_description": "Watch Celestial Church of Christ (CCC) Worldwide services live in VR. The app plays whatever is on air: the live service, Studio 2 and the CCC Worldwide 24/7 channel of past services, sermons and hymns. No sign-in needed."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://ccc-worldwide.org/privacy-policy/#our-apps", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://ccc-worldwide.org/terms-of-service/", "publisher_name": "Celestial Church of Christ Worldwide", "support_website_url": "https://ccc-worldwide.org/contact/", "website_url": "https://ccc-worldwide.org/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}, {"id": "2687655338230691"}, {"id": "1228796255027646"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommend